Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}盖好被子，宝贝。外面可冷了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Snuggle in, sweetie. It's cold out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:12.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奶奶，为什么会下雪呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is it snowing, Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:14.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雪是从哪儿来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where does it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:17.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那可说来话长了，小宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's a long story, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:21.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我想听。  -哦，今晚不行。快睡吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I wanna hear.   -Oh, not tonight. Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:24.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不困。求你了，讲给我听嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not sleepy. Tell me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:28.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这故事大概得从剪刀说起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess it would have to start with scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.01,0:03:37.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剪刀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，剪刀有很多种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, there are all kinds of scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曾经还有一个人，他的手就是剪刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And once there was even a man who had scissors for hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一个人？  -是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Aman?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剪刀手？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hands-scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是剪刀手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Scissorhands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:58.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道山顶上那座大宅子吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know the mansion on top of the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里闹鬼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很久很久以前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那座宅子里住着一位发明家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}an inventor lived in that mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他做过很多东西吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He made many things, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.93,0:04:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还造了一个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He also created a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他给了他内脏——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He gave him insides—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:30.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一颗心、一个大脑，什么都有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a heart, a brain, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.81,0:04:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，几乎什么都有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，那位发明家年纪很大了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, the inventor was very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还没把造出来的人完成，就去世了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He died before he got to finish the man he invented...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:47.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是那个人就独自留下——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so the man was left by himself—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:52.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不完整，孤零零的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}incomplete and all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没有名字吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他当然有名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course he had a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:01.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他叫爱德华。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His name was Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-雅芳推销！  -你不是刚来过吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Avon calling!   -Weren't you just here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有！上季之后就没来过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! Not since last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:56.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天我来给你看看我们精美的新系列，颜色更柔和……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Today I've come to show you our exquisite new line of softer colors...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}眼影、腮红和口红。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in shadows, blushes and lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要的一切，来衬托和突出你焕然一新的妆容。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything you need to accent and highlight your changing look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}焕然一新的妆容。说得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My changing look. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，不用说，我也带来了你所有旧爱产品的完整系列……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it goes without saying that I also have a complete selection of your old favorites...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:15.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些经久不衰、我们年年都离不开的产品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}those tried-and-true products we've all come to depend on year-in and year-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，佩格。我从来没跟你买过东西。你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Peg. I never buy anything from you. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:20.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我知道。再见，海伦。  -再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I know. Bye, Helen.   -Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夫人，你不用叫我来。你自己就能搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't have to call, ma'am. You could have taken care of this by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能吗？我看不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ could? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，很简单。你的食物残渣槽堵了，就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's easy. Your food trap's clogged. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:34.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看到这个灯泡了吗？你只要把它拧下来。  -嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You see this bulb here? You just unscrew this.   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它就出来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And out she pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}电视上说你们修理工很寂寞。家庭主妇也会寂寞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On TV they say you repairmen are lonely. Housewives get lonely too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:44.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然你可能没意识到，因为没人给这事拍过广告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Although you may not realize it, since they haven't made a commercial on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你把这个拿起来，轻轻地放回这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you just take this and put it back in here nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:51.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}注意别硬塞，因为它自己就能卡进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful not to force it, because it fits in there by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 然后你把这个再拧回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- And then you just screw this back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这会是谁呢？失陪一下好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, now, who could that be? Will you excuse me for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别走开，我马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, don't go anywhere. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:06.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真有意思。我一刻都不想错过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is fascinatin'. I wouldn't want to miss a moment of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:12.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上好，乔伊斯。雅芳推销。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good morning, Joyce. Avon calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，佩格，你瞎了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, Peg, have you gone blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看不见我车道上停着车吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you see there's a vehicle in my driveway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:23.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，是的。  -你居然没意识到那说明我很忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh. Yes.   -I'm surprised you don't realize that means I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们该挑口红了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, we should decide on lipsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:29.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，亲爱的，你最喜欢哪一支？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, dear, what one did you like best?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有“迷人瓦希妮”，你涂上很迷人，还有“巴希米妮之悦”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There was the Winsome Wahini, which looked charming on you, or the Bahimini Bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:37.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我两个都喜欢。  -那太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I like em both.   -Well, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会真以为我有钱吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't actually think I have any money, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}2\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}2\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:02.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天真不走运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just not my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:02.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:23.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真美啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:15.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！雅芳推销！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello! Avon calling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:03.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:14.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。我是佩格·博格斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello. I'm Peg Boggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你们这儿的雅芳销售代表。有人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your local Avon representative. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我很抱歉这样闯进来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I'm sorry to barge in like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你没有理由害怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you don't have any reason to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！这房子可真大，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! This is some huge house, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:40.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢天谢地，多亏了那些有氧……课。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank goodness for those aerobics... classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗？有人吗！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello? Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么躲在那后面？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you hiding back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不用躲着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't have to hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:50.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是佩格·博格斯。我是你们这儿的雅芳销售代表。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Peg Boggs. I'm your local Avon representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就像樱桃派一样无害——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm as harmless as cherry p—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。我看得出来我打扰到你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my. I can see that I've disturbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.09,0:14:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真蠢。我、我这就走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How stupid of me. I-I''ll just be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我还没完成。  -哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm not finished.   -Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:20.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把那些放下。别再靠近了。求你了——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put those down. Don't come any closer. Just, please—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是你的手？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:31.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是你的手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父母在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你母亲呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没有醒过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:59.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一个人吗？你就一个人住在这上面？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you alone? Do you live up here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:07.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的脸怎么了？嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened to your face? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不会伤害你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但至少……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But at the very least...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:17.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我给你上点收敛水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}let me give you a good astringent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这能防止感染。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This will help to prevent infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什么名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:37.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看你就跟我回家吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you should just come home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:16:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我——对不起。  -不不，别道歉。你尽管看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-'m—I'm sorry.   -No, no, don't be. You go ahead and look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:05.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你完全有理由激动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have every reason to be excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:11.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 上《谁在数数》了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- On Who's Counting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 有请《谁在数数》的主持人—— - 你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- And here's the host of Who's Counting— - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂。对，我是玛吉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Yeah, it's Marge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才在外面跟卡罗尔说话，佩格开车经过，车里还坐着个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was standing outside talking to Carol, and Peg drove by, and she had somebody in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.47,0:16:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你看清他长什么样了吗？  -没有，没看清。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you get a good look at him?   -No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:59.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她跟你提过家里来客人吗？  -她什么都没跟我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did she say anything to you about having a guest?   -She didn't say anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她一大清早就按我家门铃。  -不会吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-She rang my doorbell at the crack of dawn this morning.   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我在街角等你。好，再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I'll meet you on the corner. Right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 哦，该死！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Oh, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，亲爱的。这就是我们家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go, dear. This is our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你直接进去，就当自己家一样。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can just go right in and make yourself at home. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们吃点东西、喝点什么，或者你想——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll have something to eat or drink or whatever you—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:39.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，亲爱的。这是前门。来，就是这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, dear. This is the front door here. Here we go. Right in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乔伊斯，我刚看见佩格车上坐着个怪人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Joyce, I just saw this strange guy driving with Peg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没怎么看清楚。他脸色挺苍白的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't get a very good look at him. He looked kinda pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:48.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别一个人去，等我。好，再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do anything without me. Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.11,0:17:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来了！马上到！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes! Be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，这是客厅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, um, this is the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后面是卧室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back here are the bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:24.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想看照片啊。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to see the pictures. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我丈夫，比尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, this is my husband, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.61,0:18:31.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是保龄球冠军。你知道保龄球是什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a bowling champion. Do you know what bowling is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:34.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保龄球？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bowling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是在湖边钓鱼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, here they are down at the lake, fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得凯文有点闷闷不乐，因为那天他们什么都没钓到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ think Kevin looks a little glum because they didn't catch anything that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，这是我女儿，金……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, um, here's my daughter, Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:50.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿着参加高中毕业舞会的礼服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all dressed for the junior prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她现在都高三了，你信吗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a senior now, if you can believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:04.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她跟朋友去山里露营了，过几天就回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's camping in the mountains with some friends, but she'll be back in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.81,0:19:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到时候你就能见到她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can meet her then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是不是很漂亮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't she beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我的家人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，亲爱的，我带你看看房子其他地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come along, dear, and I'll show you the rest of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.05,0:19:35.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你梳洗一下，就当在自己家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you can just freshen up and make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:39.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边是厨房。想吃什么喝什么自己拿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the kitchen over there. You help yourself to anything you want to eat or drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些是葡萄。后面是卧室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are grapes. And back here are the bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你拿几条毛巾，再看看能给你找点什么穿的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me get you some towels, and I'll see what we can find for you to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:50.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？我记得这儿有比尔的一些旧衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? I think I have some of Bill's old clothes in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:52.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件正好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:54.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。这应该合你的身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here. These should just fit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:58.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 哦！别紧张，只是电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Oh! Don't be alarmed. That's just the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:02.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以去金的房间把这些换上。我马上就来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can go in Kim's room and put these on. I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，他有剪刀。对，剪刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, he has scissors. No, scissors. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他——他好像是在那儿出生的还是怎样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, he— he was born up there or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:58.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以前见过他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever seen him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:01.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我觉得他今天之前都没离开过那里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't think he's been off the grounds before today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:03.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么会跟他在一起的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you ever get together with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我得挂了。回头再聊，玛吉。再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I have to go now. I'll talk to you later, Marge. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:19.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，爱德华，我——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, Edward, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。我帮你弄这个好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dear. May I help you with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.34,0:22:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.85,0:22:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:32.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪，你把脸划伤了。我来把这个弄下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dear, you've cut your face. Let me just get this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.27,0:22:34.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-疼吗？  -不疼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Does that hurt?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不疼？好。好了，咱们把衣服穿上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No? Good. Okay. Now let's get you dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.11,0:22:40.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:44.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。很不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There we go. Very fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来很好。真的很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look fine. Just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:53.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.00,0:22:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点！我们不等你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! We can't wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你头发上还带着卷发筒呢。  -糟了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You've got rollers in your damn hair.   -Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.73,0:23:21.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.03,0:23:25.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把剪刀放哪儿了——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, what did I do with my sci—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.53,0:23:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，呃，你能帮我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, um, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:31.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我有个医生朋友，我想他能帮到你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I have a doctor friend who I think could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:39.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真的吗？  -对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.25,0:23:42.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疤痕我可以帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I can help with the scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但动手之前我想先翻翻雅芳的大手册。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I just wanna consult the big Avon handbook before doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:13.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.85,0:24:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.69,0:24:42.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文，盯着人看不礼貌，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin, it's not polite to stare, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.11,0:24:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文，想想要是别人盯着你看，你会是什么感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin, think how it would make you feel if somebody were staring at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:53.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我才不在乎。  -我在乎！所以别盯着看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I wouldn't care.   -Well / would! So don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:57.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，这对你来说肯定变化挺大的。对吧，爱德？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, this must be quite a change for you. Right, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.33,0:25:01.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是爱德华，亲爱的。我想他更喜欢别人叫他爱德华。  -啊，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Edward, dear. I think he prefers Edward.   -Ah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.08,0:25:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你在大宅子里都做些什么呀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what have you been doing with yourself up there in that big old place?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.59,0:25:08.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我敢打赌，那儿的风景一定很壮观。是吧，爱德？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bet, uh—1I bet the view must be spectacular. Huh, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:11.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-爱德华。  -嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Edward.   -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.64,0:25:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。不，我——我只是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm. No, I— I was just—
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.35,0:25:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一眼能望到大海，我猜，是吧？  -有时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-See all the way to the ocean, I bet, huh?   -Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.56,0:25:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔，能把盐和胡椒递给我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill, could I have the salt and pepper, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔，能把盐和胡椒递给我吗？谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill, could I have the salt and pepper, please? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.49,0:25:32.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.50,0:25:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.09,0:25:53.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，那玩意儿真酷。我打赌锋利得像剃刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Man, those things are cool. I bet they're razor-sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.22,0:25:56.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 对着人脖子来一下空手道劈—— - 凯文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- One karate chop to a guy's neck— - Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.39,0:26:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，面包上要抹点黄油吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, would you like some butter for your bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.23,0:26:11.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.61,0:26:13.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.41,0:26:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，周一我能带他去展示课吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, can I bring him to show-and-tell on Monday?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文，我受够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin, I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得你睡得着吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think you can sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.42,0:26:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道现在一切有点怪，但很快就会像在自己家一样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know things feel a little strange now, but soon you'll feel right at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.97,0:26:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-晚安。  -晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Good night.   -Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.74,0:27:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先涂浅色的遮瑕霜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The light concealing cream goes on first.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.20,0:27:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后晕开，晕开，再晕开。秘诀就是晕染。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then you blend and blend and blend. Blending is the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.74,0:27:46.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:48.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再多点遮瑕霜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More concealing cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.38,0:27:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的肤色真白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your complexion is so fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.09,0:27:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个呢，带一点薰衣草色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, this has a touch of lavender in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.55,0:27:58.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这儿试试。差不多就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give it a try here. Close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.89,0:28:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，这儿这样应该就行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, this should do the trick here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.27,0:28:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个新主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have another idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.19,0:28:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把疤痕盖住，从完全光滑的底子开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll cover up the scars and start with a completely smooth surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.71,0:28:31.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这破玩意儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darn this stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.58,0:28:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈特利开始挥臂。第一好球投出。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hartley into the windup. And the strike-one pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.05,0:28:37.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挥棒落空。二好球。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Swung on and missed. Strike two.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.30,0:28:40.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打中了。本队已经12支安打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Missed a hit. The club has 12 hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.43,0:28:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但记分牌上还是11支，比分3比7。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But they still have 11 on the scoreboard, and it's 3-7.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.14,0:28:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对沃伦的球数是0坏2好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}0 and 2, the count to Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.10,0:28:54.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他们把记分牌改成12支了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now they change it to 12 hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:57.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开大点声，凯文。我听不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turn it up, Kevin. I can't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.90,0:29:01.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 凯文？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.57,0:29:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈特利的二好球投出……被打爆了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hartley's strike-two pitch... is hammered!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.95,0:29:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你听见了吗，博格斯先生？  -没有！再大声点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you hear that, Mr. Boggs?   -No! Make it louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}飞出去了！全垒打！创造历史了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gone! It's out of here! It's history!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.71,0:29:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-爸，快看！  -马丁内斯满贯全垒打……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Dad. Look!   -A grand slam for Martinez...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.84,0:29:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一局拿下五分，把这场比赛彻底打爆了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to make it a five-run inning and blow this game to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.43,0:29:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 真没想到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- I'll be darned.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.78,0:29:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 他们把整盘带子都录满了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- They filled the whole tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.28,0:29:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 那边到底怎么回事？给我打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- What's going on over there? Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.41,0:29:49.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，我是玛吉。他是谁？给我打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, it's Marge. Who is he? Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.54,0:29:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对了，我听说山上雨下得很大。你说孩子们没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, by the way, I hear it's pouring rain in the mountains. You think the kids are okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.29,0:29:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 嘿，亲爱的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Hey there, darlin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.58,0:29:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姐妹们都为你那位神秘客人激动得不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The gals are all in a tizzy about your secret visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.21,0:30:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能一直把他藏着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't keep him a secret forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.35,0:30:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩顿，职业生涯最高平均213——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Peyton, with a career-high average of 213—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.23,0:30:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，真是太棒了，埃德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it's just wonderful, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.52,0:30:20.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，你把全家人都刻进去了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My God, you have the whole family in there, don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.37,0:30:28.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.87,0:30:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来个全中怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about a strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.41,0:30:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不！那主意太糟了，孩子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no! That's a terrible idea, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.00,0:30:42.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去把油壶拿来。咱们可不想让他生锈，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go and get the oil can. We don't want him rusting up on us, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.56,0:30:52.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，爱德华！你刻的是我们？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Edward! You did us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，比尔，是我们！  -是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, Bill, it's us!   -Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.64,0:30:58.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，爱德华！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.27,0:31:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不是从天堂来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not heaven he's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.48,0:31:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是直接从地狱的臭火里来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's straight from the stinking flames of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:06.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他身上有撒旦的力量。我能感觉到。你们感觉不到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The power of Satan is in him. I can feel it. Can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:09.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你们这些可怜的羊，偏离正道这么远了吗？  -我们不是羊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Have you poor sheep strayed so far from the path?   -We're not sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.87,0:31:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别靠近我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't come near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.87,0:31:18.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 对，走吧。滚出去。快跑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- That's right, go on. Get out of here. Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.50,0:31:20.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，别听她的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, don't you listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.00,0:31:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别在意她，爱德华。她就是个老疯子，仅此而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about her, Edward. She's just an old loony, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.39,0:31:35.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗨！  -你们全躲在里面，像一群寄居蟹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi!   -You all are hidin' in there like a bunch of hermit crabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.94,0:31:40.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗨，乔伊斯。嗨！  -真不害臊，把这么特别的客人一个人霸着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi, Joyce. Hi!   -Shame on you, keeping your unusual guest all to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.02,0:31:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都觉得你太自私了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We think that's mighty selfish of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-最近实在太忙了。  -你想弥补一下，真是太贴心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Things have been hectic.   -That is so sweet of you to want to correct the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-烧烤会几点开始？  -烧烤会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What time does the barbecue begin?   -Barbecue?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.83,0:31:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算好好招待客人，把他介绍给朋友们，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You intend to show your guest hospitality by introducing him to your friends, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.62,0:31:58.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我带凉拌卷心菜。  -我带甜点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll bring coleslaw.   -I'll bring dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.29,0:32:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来带仙果沙拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And / will bring the ambrosia salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你说的是几点来着？  -几点？呃，比尔——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What time was it that you said?   -What time? Uh, Bill—
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.46,0:32:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 大概5点？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- About 5:00?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.76,0:32:11.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-比尔！  -他是先被派来诱惑你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bill!   -He has been sent first to tempt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但还不算晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.02,0:32:19.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须把他推开，赶走他，踩碎这违背自然的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must push him from you, expel him, trample down the perversion of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.90,0:32:23.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你们听见了吗？说他是违背自然的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, did you hear that? He's a perversion of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.48,0:32:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，这不是很刺激吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, isn't that excitin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.82,0:32:32.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-回头见。  -再见！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-See ya later.   -Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.41,0:32:38.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔！比尔？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill! Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.92,0:32:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直说，野餐也好烧烤也好，没有芥末蛋可不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've always said you can't have a picnic or a barbecue without deviled eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.25,0:32:47.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们最棒了。有了才算像样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're just the best. They make a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.59,0:32:50.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪！爱德华！太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dear! Edward! That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.55,0:32:54.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你把整棵都切了，不过我们会有一大盘——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know you chopped the whole thing, but we'll have a really big—
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.39,0:32:56.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好了，现在。就剪一小下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. All right, now. Just a nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.98,0:32:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用紧张，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no need to be nervous, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.52,0:33:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃斯梅拉达不会来的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Esmeralda won't be here...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.02,0:33:05.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其他邻居呢，他们都特别好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the rest of the neighbors, they're really very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.28,0:33:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用紧张。他们都很想见你。你只要做你自己就好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no need to be nervous. They're so eager to meet you. You just have to be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.49,0:33:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我自己？  -对。就做你可爱的自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Myself?   -That's right. Just your own sweet self.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.71,0:35:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}[夏威夷音乐]\N{\rEN\blur0.8}os [ Hawaiian I
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.80,0:35:43.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，爱德华。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.10,0:35:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-跟我们玩「剪刀石头布」吧。  -玩剪刀什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Play "Scissors, Paper, Stones" with us.   -Play Scissors-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.48,0:35:49.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个医生朋友，也许能帮上你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got a doctor friend of mine might be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.61,0:35:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看起来太不可思议了。  -他就那么一下子弄好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It looks incredible.   -And he did it just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.44,0:35:54.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是太不可思议了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's really incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:56.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，迈克！你好——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Mike! How you do—
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.91,0:35:59.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，杰克。嘿，孩子们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Jack. Hey, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.62,0:36:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！你好！乔治·门罗——哇！你这握手劲儿可真大，埃德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hi! George Monroe— Whoa! That's a heck of a handshake you got there, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈里！哈里！我上周在高尔夫球场看见你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harry! Harry! I saw you on the golf course last week!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.83,0:36:11.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很喜欢。我们买了一打甜瓜和一打菠萝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love em. We got a dozen of the melon and a dozen of the pineapple.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.59,0:36:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？想吃点什么吗？你饿吗？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay? Do you want something to eat? Are you hungry? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.84,0:36:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-要块饼干吗？  -他真特别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You want a cracker?   -He's so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.97,0:36:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-完全不一样。  -可不是嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Completely different.   -No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.93,0:36:24.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他真是—— - 神秘。  -是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's so— - Mysterious.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.56,0:36:28.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 你觉得他那双手是热的还是凉的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Do you imagine those hands are hot or cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.44,0:36:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想想剪一下能做什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And just think what a single snip could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.56,0:36:34.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 或者能毁掉什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Or undo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.32,0:36:36.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-艾迪。艾迪。  -哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Eddie. Eddie.   -Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.74,0:36:40.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和大伙儿聊过了。想请你周五晚上来打牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The guys and I were talkin'. We'd like to invite you to our card game Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.91,0:36:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想去吗？就是一点，你可不能切牌！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you like that? Only thing is, you can't cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.25,0:36:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}os»
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.96,0:36:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己也有毛病。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have my own infirmity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.47,0:37:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从没让我吃过一点亏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never did me a bit of harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.76,0:37:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}战争时中过弹片……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Took some shrapnel during the war...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.26,0:37:07.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从那以后我就什么感觉都没有——一点都没有！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and ever since then I can't feel a thing— not a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.85,0:37:11.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让任何人说你残疾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you ever let anybody tell you you have a handicap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.35,0:37:15.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁残疾了？天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's handicapped? My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.11,0:37:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别胡说。你不是残疾。你是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be ridiculous. You're not handicapped. You're—
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.78,0:37:21.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那叫什么来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do they call that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.16,0:37:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非凡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.49,0:37:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫乔伊斯，我注意到你还没尝过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My name's Joyce, and I noticed that you have not tasted...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.00,0:37:31.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我特意为你做的神馔沙拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}any of the ambrosia salad that I made especially for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.80,0:37:41.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯！嗯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm! Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.05,0:37:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 你一定得尝尝。这是我妈妈的配方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- You must try this. It's my mother's recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:48.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天，让他先嚼完吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let him chew, for heaven's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.22,0:37:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没见过你这么会种东西的人。我家真需要你帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've never seen a green thumb like yours. I sure could use your help at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.56,0:37:55.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 我要一排天使。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- I want a row of angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.19,0:37:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真抱歉各位女士，但他答应先来我家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry, ladies, but he's promised to come to my house first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.94,0:38:01.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是吧，艾迪？  -嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Haven't you, Eddie?   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.24,0:38:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了各位，拿好盘子！开饭了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, everybody, grab your plates! Soup's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.03,0:38:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我以为这是烤肉串。  -什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I thought this was shish kebab.   -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.16,0:38:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我以为这是烤肉串。  -是啊，没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I thought this was shish kebab.   -Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.29,0:38:14.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是比喻。你得学会别什么都照字面理解。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a figure of speech. You gotta learn not to take things so literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.59,0:38:24.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“让我们假装此刻在客厅里，女主人正在上茶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Let us pretend that we are in the drawing room and the hostess is serving tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.43,0:38:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“现在我们面临许多许多小问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Now many, numerous little questions confront us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.27,0:38:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“男士接茶时应该站起来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Should the man rise when he accepts his cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.65,0:38:39.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}方糖可以用手拿吗？”嗯，不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May lump sugar be taken with the fingers?" Mmm, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.82,0:38:43.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“接受第二杯茶是否得体？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Is it good form to accept a second cup?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.57,0:38:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“那么，餐巾应该完全展开……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Now, should the napkin be entirely unfolded...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.66,0:38:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“还是保留中间的折痕？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"or should the center crease be allowed to remain?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.08,0:38:53.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“犯下尴尬的错误实在太容易了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"It is So easy to commit embarrassing blunders...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.75,0:38:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“但礼仪告诉我们该怎么做……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"but etiquette tells us just what is expected of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.38,0:39:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并保护我们免于羞辱和不适。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and guards us from all humiliation and discomfort."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.72,0:39:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，对。无聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm, yes. Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.81,0:39:13.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们换成，呃——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let us switch to, um—
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.56,0:39:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}换成诗歌，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to some poetry, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.98,0:39:23.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“有一位来自海角的老翁……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"There was an old man from the cape...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.19,0:39:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“他用绉纱给自己做衣裳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"who made himself garments of crepe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.45,0:39:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“有人问‘会撕破吗？’他答：‘这儿那儿会！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"When asked, 'Will they tear?' he replied, 'Here and there!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.95,0:39:34.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但它们保持着多美的形状！’”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But they keep such a beautiful shape!"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.29,0:39:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了。来吧。笑一笑。很好笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right. Go ahead. Smile. It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.00,0:39:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.40,0:40:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 好了，伙计们，我们到家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Okay, you guys, we're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.82,0:40:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘘！  -真不敢相信还全都湿透了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shh!   -I can't believe everything's still sopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.45,0:40:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我恨不得马上冲个澡洗掉霉味。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can hardly wait to take a shower and wash off the mildew.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.58,0:40:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-或者睡到床上。  -要是我爸妈设了警报，我就惨了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Or to sleep in a bed.   -If my parents have the alarm set, I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.70,0:40:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我又得睡院子了。  -我叫你给他们打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll have to sleep in the yard again.   -I told you to call them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.21,0:40:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对啊。你打了吗？  -没有。他宁愿抱怨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's right. But did you?   -Nope. He'd rather complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.34,0:40:25.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然我怎么当焦点，啊？你也没给你爸妈打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How else am I supposed to be the center of attention, huh? You didn't call your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.30,0:40:28.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们家不像警察国家。再见，伙计们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They don't run their house like a police state. Bye, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.84,0:40:31.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好。回头见。  -再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay. See you later.   -Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.14,0:40:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-再见。  -再见。别忘了你的胳膊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bye.   -Bye. Don't forget your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.43,0:40:35.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，对。  -走吧，吉姆，我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, yeah.   -Come on, Jim, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.74,0:40:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}2\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.63,0:41:04.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（续）\N{\rEN\blur0.8}¢e I Continues ]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.45,0:41:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我房间里有个人！去看看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's somebody in my room! Go look!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.58,0:41:41.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是杀人犯！他拿着斧头！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a murderer! He has an ax!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.16,0:41:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你什么时候回来的？  -他想杀我！去看看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-When did you get home?   -He tried to kill me! Go look!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.29,0:41:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事了。没事了。回去睡吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right. It's all right. Go back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.17,0:41:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在那儿！天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There he is! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.88,0:41:52.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是我们的爱德华！  -他是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's our Edward!   -Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.14,0:41:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 那是爱德华—— - 爱德华？你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- That's Edward— - Edward? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.26,0:41:58.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华来跟我们一起住了。没什么好担心的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward's come to live with us. There is nothing to be upset about.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.27,0:42:00.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-妈，他拿着斧头！  -不不。没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mom, he had an ax!   -No, no. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.94,0:42:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们马上给你在这儿安顿好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, we'll have you set up here in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.06,0:42:07.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿有张标准的双人床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got a full queen-size bed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.73,0:42:12.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都铺好了。好。这就行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all made and everything. Good. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.11,0:42:14.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？出什么事了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the matter? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.03,0:42:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她让你紧张了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She get you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.16,0:42:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在那座城堡里关得太久了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been cloistered away up in that castle too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.96,0:42:25.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对十几岁女孩的奇妙世界一无所知。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know anything about the wonderful world of teenage girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.33,0:42:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们全都疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're all crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.88,0:42:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-给。这个能让你镇定下来。  -这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Here. This will straighten you right out.   -What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.51,0:42:33.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柠檬水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lemonade.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.26,0:42:41.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道是什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.60,0:42:44.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们到了一定年纪……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They reach a certain age...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.60,0:42:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就长出这些腺体什么的，身体会肿起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they develop these gland things, their bodies swell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.19,0:42:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们就疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.78,0:42:55.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}腺体？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Glands?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.95,0:42:59.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，腺体。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, glands.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 我尽量不去想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- I try not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.60,0:43:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好喝吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.27,0:43:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚你先睡凯文的房间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, you stay in Kevin's room tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.39,0:43:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天我们把你的房间收拾好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tomorrow, we'll fix your room right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.90,0:43:31.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你为什么把他带回来？  -我不能把他一个人丢在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why did you bring him here?   -I couldn't have left him up there all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.65,0:43:35.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你也会这么做的。  -他为什么非得住这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You would've done the same thing.   -Why does he have to stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.20,0:43:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，金。我真没想到你会这样。他那样也不是他自己能选的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my goodness, Kim. I'm surprised at you. He can't help the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.95,0:43:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-有点同情心。  -我是有同情心的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Have a little sympathy.   -I do have sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.08,0:43:45.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就去跟他打个招呼。下楼来，跟人家握个手——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then let's say hello to him. Just come downstairs, shake the man's hand—
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.75,0:43:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-跟他握手？  -也不是真握。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shake his hand?   -Well, not literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.88,0:43:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-天哪，你把他吓得半死。  -吓得半死？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Goodness, you scared him half to death.   -/ scared him to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.05,0:43:59.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，比尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.51,0:44:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想让你们俩正式认识一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted you two to have a proper introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.85,0:44:06.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，这是我们的女儿，金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, this is our daughter, Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.35,0:44:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金，这是爱德华，他要和我们一起住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kim, this is Edward, who's gonna live with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.69,0:44:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.20,0:44:26.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}2\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.83,0:44:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}»\N{\rEN\blur0.8}»
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.96,0:44:34.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃迪！渴了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eddie! Thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.05,0:44:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 小亲亲！别吵了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Kisses! Hush up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.72,0:44:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘘！安静点！  -J\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shh! Quiet now!   -J
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.35,0:44:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，我连自己想什么都听不见了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darlin', I can hardly hear myself think!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.48,0:44:50.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，妈妈宝贝的小女儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, mama's precious little baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.69,0:44:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想不想来杯冰凉的柠檬水？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wouldn't you like a nice, cool glass of lemonade?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:44:59.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柠檬水？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lemonade?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.04,0:45:13.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往人脖子上一剪，就全完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One chop to a guy's neck, and it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.34,0:45:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 那是世上最锋利的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- They're the sharpest things in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.88,0:45:19.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都能剪断，而且——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They can hack through anything, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.86,0:45:41.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得它们看着怪怪的，让我发毛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think they look weird. They give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.49,0:45:44.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你该看看彼得斯小姐院子前那个小丑。  -金！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You should see the clown in front of Miss Peters's yard.   -Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.82,0:45:47.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-噢，不会吧。  -就是他？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, no.   -That's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.95,0:45:50.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他在叫你，金芭。  -别说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's callin' you, Kimba.   -Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.41,0:45:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，你忘了你的饼干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, you forgot your cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.71,0:45:59.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 别担心，埃迪。她在等你呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Don't worry, Eddie. She's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.22,0:46:11.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔，爱德华跟我说他今天在杰姬家吃午饭了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill. Edward was telling me he had lunch at Jackie's today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.39,0:46:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她厨房刚整个翻新过。  -真没想到！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-She just had her kitchen completely redone.   -/'1! be darned!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.52,0:46:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}新油漆、新橱柜、新地板、新微波炉、新的静音洗碗机——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}New paint, new cabinets, new floors, anew microwave, new silent dishwasher—
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.07,0:46:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-多好啊！  -真是了不起！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Isn't that wonderful!   -Isn't that something?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.53,0:46:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉姆，你不是说你妈也把厨房翻新了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jim, didn't you tell me your mom had her kitchen done too?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.32,0:46:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是啊。我爸给自己买了一堆新玩具。  -真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah. My dad bought himself a bunch of new toys.   -Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.45,0:46:29.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大屏幕电视、CD 播放器、四磁头录像机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Big-screen TV, CD players, VCR with four heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.87,0:46:32.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My goodness sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.25,0:46:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不知道那么有钱是什么感觉。  -他们什么都锁起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I wonder what it's like to be that rich.   -They keep things locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.46,0:46:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸有个专门的房间放他的东西，就怕我用上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father has his own room for his stuff to make sure I can't get any use of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.59,0:46:42.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他小气得很，连帮我买辆旧车都不肯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's so cheap, he won't even help me buy an old car.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.72,0:46:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他大概是想让你自己付钱。我同意他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He probably wants you to pay for it yourself. I agree with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.18,0:46:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能磨练品格。你会更珍惜的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Builds character. You'll appreciate it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.64,0:46:49.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.93,0:46:53.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说到钱，我听说你剪枝修草都不收钱，爱德华。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Speaking of money, I understand you're not charging for your gardening, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.64,0:46:57.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啦，比尔，玛吉今天还给他烤了饼干呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, Bill, Marge made him cookies today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.15,0:46:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweetheart...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.86,0:47:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饼干可买不来生活必需品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you can't buy the necessities of life with cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.03,0:47:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饼干可买不了车。我说得对吧，吉姆？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't buy a car with cookies. Am I right, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.37,0:47:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，先生。买不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's true, sir. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.00,0:47:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我吃不了那个。他用手拿的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I can't eat that. He used his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.42,0:47:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得不卫生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think it's sanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.26,0:47:23.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.84,0:47:30.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，要我帮你收拾吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, you want me to help you clean that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.18,0:47:34.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用，没关系。我马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, that's okay. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.94,0:48:26.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚历克西斯？噢，这不可能是我的亚历克西斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alexis? Oh, this can't possibly be my Alexis!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.70,0:48:29.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她看起来太美了！看看你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She looks so beautiful! Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.03,0:48:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}宝贝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.28,0:48:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.79,0:48:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会太久的。她只要定下发型就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It won't be long. She just has to decide on the style.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后就没事了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.80,0:48:52.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她只要决定想要什么发型。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She just has to decide what style she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.30,0:48:56.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要个大一点、蓬松点的，你懂的。有点像我这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was hoping for somethin' big and kinda bouffant, you know. Kinda like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.77,0:49:01.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心，小亲亲。你会没事的。你会非常漂亮的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you worry, Kisses. You're gonna be just fine. You're gonna be so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.86,0:49:05.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，你会的。噢！我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, you are. Oh! Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.32,0:49:08.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.50,0:49:23.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，埃迪，还有什么是你做不到的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Eddie, is there anything you can't do?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.29,0:49:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我都喘不过气了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've taken my very breath away.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.59,0:49:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓！看看这个！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.42,0:49:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给女人剪过头发吗？能帮我剪吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever cut a woman's hair? Would you cut mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.00,0:50:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我这辈子最刺激的一次经历。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was the single most thrillin' experience of my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.86,0:51:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们要接通公司总裁了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're getting the head of the company!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.98,0:51:55.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我回来了！  -嗨，亲爱的！我们在这儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-l''m home!   -Hi, honey! We're in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.11,0:51:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Hi- - Hi
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.41,0:52:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你头发怎么了？  -爱德华剪的。很野吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What did you do to your hair?   -Edward cut it. Isn't it wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.20,0:52:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是佩格·博格斯吗？  -喂？噢，真不敢相信我在跟你本人说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Is this Peg Boggs?   -Hello? Oh, I can't believe I'm talking to you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.83,0:52:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-太荣幸了。  -呃，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is such an honor.   -Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.54,0:52:11.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。是的，他就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Yes, he's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.75,0:52:15.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 太好了。那你对他很了解？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Great. So then you know all about him? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.47,0:52:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我用的就是这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's exactly what I've been using.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.30,0:52:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我有点调不出合适的稠度。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I've had a little trouble getting it the right consistency.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.85,0:52:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯，就差一点。  -加 21 号红。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Well, just a little.   -Add 21 Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.27,0:52:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我试试。嗯哼。  -再加一点 418 号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-ll try that. Uh-huh.   -And then a dash of 418.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.90,0:52:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，多有创意的建议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what imaginative suggestions.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.90,0:52:36.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一定照做。太感谢你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I sure will. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.70,0:52:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-再见。  -再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bye-bye.   -Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.99,0:52:42.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难怪她是公司总裁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No wonder she's the head of the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.12,0:52:45.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她也是从销售代表做起的，跟我一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She started out as a Sales representative just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.33,0:52:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直想跟她说话，可之前一直没理由。谢谢你，爱德华。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've always wanted to talk to her, but until now I never had a reason. Thanks, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.54,0:52:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她给了些建议？  -当然给了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-She had some ideas?   -You bet she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.46,0:52:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯哼。  -嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uh-huh.   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.31,0:53:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}rll get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.31,0:53:53.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华。我们到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.81,0:53:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。给你磨磨剪刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Let's get you sharpened up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.99,0:54:04.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你带了吗？  -没有。真不敢相信。真烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You got it?   -No. I can't believe this. This is such a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.62,0:54:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.46,0:54:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-再见。  -再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bye-bye.   -Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.29,0:54:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你带钥匙了吗？  -没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you have a key?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.13,0:54:21.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我明明记得放在这儿了。  -那我们被困住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I could've sworn I put it here somewhere.   -Well, we're stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.68,0:54:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！谢谢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.81,0:54:31.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃德！真够意思。干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ed! What a guy. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.10,0:54:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没弄坏也没刮花什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't break it or scratch it or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.48,0:54:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮个忙，佩格回来时喊一声。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be a pal and yell when Peg pulls in.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.65,0:54:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 挺精彩的故事，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Quite a story, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.69,0:54:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么问题想问爱德华吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any questions for Edward?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.24,0:54:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，再往那边靠靠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Get way over.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.45,0:54:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-请站起来。  -你在这个小镇的新生活里，最棒的是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stand right up.   -What's been the best part of your new life here in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.20,0:54:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}交到的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The friends I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.54,0:54:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 还有别的问题吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Any other questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.46,0:55:01.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有没有想过做矫正手术或装义肢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever thought of having corrective surgery or prosthetics?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.30,0:55:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我认识一位医生，也许能帮你。  -我想见见他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-lknowa doctor that might be able to help you.   -I'd like to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.55,0:55:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}节目结束后我们再说医生的名字。谢谢，真贴心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll give that name after the show. Thank you. That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.18,0:55:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有谁？好，请站起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyone else? Yes. Stand right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.56,0:55:17.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-可如果你有普通人的手，你就会跟别人一样。  -是的，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But if you had regular hands you'd be like everyone else.   -Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.31,0:55:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我觉得他会喜欢那样。  -可那样就没人觉得你特别了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I think he'd like that.   -But then no one would think you were special.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.74,0:55:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就不会上电视什么的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't be on TV or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.95,0:55:28.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管怎样，爱德华永远都是特别的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No matter what, Edward will always be special.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.66,0:55:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有问题吗？好，请站起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More questions? Yes. Stand right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.00,0:55:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的作品非常有趣、独特，与众不同。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your work is so interesting, distinctive and unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.13,0:55:43.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你有计划开自己的美容院吗？  -哦，这主意不错！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you have any plans to open your own beauty salon?   -Oh, there's an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.34,0:55:50.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有谁？呃，好，请站起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyone else? Uh, yeah. Stand right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.18,0:55:53.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你有女朋友吗？  -哎呀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you have a girlfriend?   -Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.23,0:55:59.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-当然有。对吧，金？  -对吧，金？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Sure he does. Right, Kim?   -Right, Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.73,0:56:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好极了，你把他惹起来了。  -别闹了，翘屁股。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Great. Now you got him started.   -Knock it off, bubble-butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.48,0:56:05.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是你干的。  -那又怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You did it.   -So?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.74,0:56:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么样，爱德华？你生命中有没有一位特别的女士？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about it, Edward? Is there some special lady in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.70,0:56:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.52,0:56:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-呃，  -切都还好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Uh, everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.32,0:56:45.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们休息一下，广告之后马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll take a break and be right back after these messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.82,0:56:48.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 观众：你笑什么？他受伤了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- AS - Why are you laughing? He got hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.95,0:56:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-只是轻微电了一下。你管得着吗？  -“轻微电一下”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Just a little shock. What do you care?   -"A little shock"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.37,0:56:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真希望我们刚才录下来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wish we'd been taping that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.66,0:56:56.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我宁愿割了左蛋也想再看一遍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd give my left nut to see that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.62,0:57:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不激动吗？哦，这真是太刺激了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aren't you excited? Oh, this is just so thrilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.54,0:57:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我拿给你看。太完美了，正是我们一直在找的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait'll I show it to you. It's just perfect. It's just what we've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.46,0:57:08.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想叫它“剪上天堂”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to call it Shear Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.01,0:57:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！我们到了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! And here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.76,0:57:14.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，这一整排，我要装一排新镜子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, all along here, I'm gonna put a row of new mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.02,0:57:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后后面这一带，嗯，我想——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And back along here, well, I think—
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.56,0:57:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃迪，过来，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eddie. Come along, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.73,0:57:22.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再回到这边，一整排新化妆品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back up here, a whole row of new cosmetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.73,0:57:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有这一排——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And all along this row here—
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.52,0:57:28.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 佩格可以卖化妆品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Peg could sell cosmetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.44,0:57:32.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，当然。这里当然是洗头的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Sure. And this, of course, is where we wash the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.87,0:57:36.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是我迎接顾客时站的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And here is where I stand when I greet the customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.79,0:57:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但后面这里才是真正想给你看的——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But back in here is what I really want to show you—
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.96,0:57:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.96,0:57:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是我真正想给你看的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is what I really want to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.13,0:57:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是储藏室，我们什么都放这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, this is the storeroom where we keep everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.93,0:57:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天我需要你帮我拿个主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What I need from you today is a decision I need you to help me make.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.72,0:57:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 哦，亲爱的，不行！别这样，很危险。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Oh, honey, no! Don't. That's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.60,0:58:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就坐那儿吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, you just sit right down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.27,0:58:08.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有几件罩衫。要我穿给你看看吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have some smocks. Would you like me to model them for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.11,0:58:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.95,0:58:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}浪漫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ee I Romantic ]
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.75,0:58:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}»\N{\rEN\blur0.8}»
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.93,0:58:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我最喜欢的一件……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, this is my favorite...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.14,0:58:44.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为它是黄色的——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because it's yellow—
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.77,0:58:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它的用处是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what it's for...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.48,0:58:53.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接住掉进脖子里那些刺痒的小碎发。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is to catch those itchy little trimmings that fall down in your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.45,0:58:58.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后还有这件旧的紫色罩衫，你知道……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then there's this old purple one, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.95,0:59:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样往身上一披。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you just kind of drape around you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.62,0:59:07.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我喜欢那件。  -哦，埃迪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I like that one.   -Oh, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.80,0:59:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，埃迪，你在发抖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, Eddie, you're trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.92,0:59:17.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So aml.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.18,0:59:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我等这一刻已经等太久了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have been waiting for this moment for so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.22,1:00:03.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.39,1:00:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，你给我回来！你不能这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, you come back here! You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.70,1:00:22.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是魔术贴，亲爱的。魔术贴，挂在仪表板上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Velcro, sweetheart. Velcro, and it hangs on the dashboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.37,1:00:24.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我从没见过那样的。  -抱歉我迟到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I've never seen that.   -Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.87,1:00:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，爱德华。抱歉，亲爱的，我们只好先点菜了。给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Edward. Sorry, dear. We had to order without you. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.96,1:00:31.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，爱德华，你今天过得有收获吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Edward, did you have a productive day?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.75,1:00:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}门罗太太带我看了美容院将来的位置。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mrs. Monroe showed me where the salon's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.76,1:00:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你可以设个化妆品柜台。  -那不是很棒吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You could have a cosmetics counter.   -Wouldn't that be great?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.97,1:00:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.10,1:00:44.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后她带我去看后面的房间，她在那里把衣服全脱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then she showed me the backroom, where she took all of her clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.56,1:00:48.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，我说不出我有多激动。我真是高兴极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, I can't tell you how thrilled / am. I'm just as pleased as punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.40,1:00:51.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整个美容院这门生意会教你很多东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This whole beauty parlor venture's gonna teach you volumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.40,1:00:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自己经营生意是无与伦比的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing like running your own business.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.15,1:00:57.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己从没做过，但据我所知……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've never done it myself, but from what I gather...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.11,1:00:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一个劳动者能得到的最大满足。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's the greatest satisfaction a working man can have.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.07,1:01:03.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我想，下一步你该去银行了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I guess the bank's gonna be your next step, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.91,1:01:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-银行？  -对，贷笔款，把生意做起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-The bank?   -Yeah, take out a loan, get yourself started.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.12,1:01:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么好担心的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.29,1:01:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以你的才华和名声，这轻而易举。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With your talent and reputation, it's gonna be a snap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.09,1:01:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.51,1:01:23.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有信用记录。没有工作履历。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No credit. No record of jobs you've held.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.60,1:01:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有存款。没有个人投资。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No savings. No personal investments.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.14,1:01:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有社保号。你简直就像根本不存在一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No Social Security number. You may as well not even exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.19,1:01:33.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有抵押物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is no collateral.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.36,1:01:36.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，我们的房子已经做过二次抵押了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we already have a second on the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.11,1:01:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这些推荐信难道不算数吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But don't the testimonials make a difference?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.44,1:01:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到这里了吗？镇长夫人都迫不及待想成为客户了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see here? The mayor's wife can't wait to become a client.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.28,1:01:44.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们实在办不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We simply can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.45,1:01:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先给自己弄张社保卡，建立信用……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, get yourself a Social Security card, establish credit...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.87,1:01:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再给自己买辆车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and buy yourself a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.04,1:01:53.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有个明显的优势。你可以申请残疾人停车证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a decided advantage. You can get one of those handicapped placards.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.29,1:01:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题。你想停哪儿就停哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No problem. Park anywhere you like.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.63,1:02:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信。这简直太过分了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe it. It's just an outrage.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.55,1:02:04.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你别担心，这事没完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But don't you worry. This isn't the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.35,1:02:06.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们总会帮你弄到钱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll get your money somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.14,1:02:10.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可那是入室盗窃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But that's breaking and entering.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.48,1:02:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸妈保险买得足足的。他们能损失什么？一点麻烦而已？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My parents have insurance up the rear. What'll it cost them? A little hassle?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.81,1:02:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一周后，我爸什么都会换成新的、更好的。  -我们不能这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Aweek, and my dad will have a new and better everything.   -We can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.86,1:02:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-听着，有人愿意给现金收这些东西。  -吉姆，我不想干。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Look, there's a guy who'll give us cash for this stuff.   -Jim, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.36,1:02:24.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不想像丹尼那样有辆我们自己的面包车，能单独待着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want us to have our own van like Denny's where we can be by ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.08,1:02:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后面还放张床垫？——你怎么就不能去做呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-With a mattress in the back?   -Why can't you just do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.87,1:02:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸把那该死的房间锁着。得让爱德华帮我们进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father keeps the damn room locked. We need Edward to get us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.08,1:02:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能趁他睡觉的时候把钥匙拿出来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't you take the key, like, when he's sleeping or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.54,1:02:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他攥得比那更紧的只有他的老二。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only thing he hangs onto tighter is his dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.59,1:02:38.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，金。剪刀手什么都肯为你做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Kim. Razor blades will do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.84,1:02:41.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么意思？不是那样的。——是吗？你去问问他啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you mean? That's not true.   -No? Why don't you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.72,1:02:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不公平。——跟公平有什么关系？没别的办法了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's not fair.   -What's fair got to do with it? There isn't any other way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.34,1:02:47.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定还有别的办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.51,1:02:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我绞尽脑汁了。你不想我们有辆自己的车吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I've wracked my brain. Don't you want us to have our own van?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.27,1:02:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.61,1:02:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉姆，灯亮着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jim, the lights are on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.78,1:03:02.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会。那些是自动亮的。他们周末不在家，我跟你说过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Those go on automatically. They're gone for the weekend. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.11,1:03:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，是防贼用的。——你把警报关了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's right. In case of burglars.   -You turned off the alarm?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.03,1:03:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说呢？来吧，走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think? Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.20,1:03:09.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我讨厌这样。真不敢相信会这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate this. I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.54,1:03:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定他不知道这是吉姆家？——他从没来过这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you sure he doesn't know this is Jim's house?   -He's never been here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.12,1:03:15.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这人偷过你东西？——嘘！小声点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This person stole from you?   -Shh! Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.79,1:03:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了，他偷了。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you, he stole. Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.38,1:03:20.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他父母，他们会让他还回来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell his parents, and they'll make him give it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.76,1:03:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘘。我试过了，可这家伙的父母跟他一个样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shh. I already tried, but the guy's parents are like he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.55,1:03:27.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟金说好要做的。来吧。走。快点，快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You told Kim you'd do this. Come on. Let's go. Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:30.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.93,1:03:35.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。快点。快点。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Come on. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.44,1:03:38.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点。快点！快点！天啊。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come on! Come on! Oh, my God. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.59,1:04:06.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那混蛋把它单独接了线。快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The bastard had it wired separately. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.13,1:04:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，吉姆！我们不能就这么把他丢在这儿！——快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, Jim! We can't just leave him here!   -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.43,1:04:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点！快点！别停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Come on! Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.60,1:04:18.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走。——我做不到！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on.   -I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.77,1:04:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走，金。——住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on, Kim.   -Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.11,1:04:23.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放我下来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.97,1:04:53.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们知道你在里面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.35,1:04:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们正在关闭系统，好让你出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're in the process of deactivating the system so that you can come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.49,1:05:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹尼，掉头！——没门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Denny, turn around!   -No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.66,1:05:15.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吉姆，这是你家。触发警报他们不能抓你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jim, it's your house. They can't arrest you for setting off the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.91,1:05:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只说……就说我们吓坏了跑掉了！——我们不回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We'll just— We'll tell 'em we freaked and ran!   -We're not going back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.16,1:05:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得回去！——不行，我爸会起诉的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We have to go back!   -No, because my father would prosecute!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.04,1:05:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他自己的儿子？——尤其是他自己的儿子！要是爱德华说出去，我杀了他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-His own son?   -Especially his own son! If Edward tells, I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.26,1:05:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}丹尼，掉头！——不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Denny, turn around!   -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.42,1:05:30.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}掉头！你必须掉头！——不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Turn around! You have to!   -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.68,1:05:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手举高，让我们看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We want your hands high in the air where we can see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.44,1:05:41.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手举起来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.90,1:05:49.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他手里有东西，看起来像刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's got something in his hands— looks like knives.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.90,1:05:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放下武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drop your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.45,1:05:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重复——放下武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/ repeat— drop your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.37,1:05:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我再问你一次。这是最后警告。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna ask you one more time. This is your last warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.12,1:06:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放下武器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drop your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.88,1:06:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则我们就开枪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}/f you fail to do so, we'll have to open fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.55,1:06:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别逼我们，伙计！放下武器！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't make us do that, buddy! Drop your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.38,1:06:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上放下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drop them now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.39,1:06:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来是个疯子。准备开枪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks like we got a psycho. Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.14,1:06:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，不！——退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, no, no!   -Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.31,1:06:22.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是他的手！那不是武器！那是他的手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are his hands! Those aren't weapons! Those are his hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.44,1:06:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，我们认识他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, we know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.77,1:06:27.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。铐上他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Cuff him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.70,1:06:36.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们现在能见他了吗？——现在可以了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But we can see him now?   -You can see him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.91,1:06:40.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得留他过夜观察。——他得待一整晚？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We're gonna have to hold him overnight for observation.   -He has to stay all night?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.16,1:06:43.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上你们可以来接他。——哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You can pick him up in the morning.   -Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.42,1:06:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，爱德华。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.58,1:06:50.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，爱德华。哦，亲爱的爱德华。都怪我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Edward. Oh, Edward, dear. I blame myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.51,1:06:53.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子，你到底在想什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What in God's name was going through your mind, son?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.51,1:06:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么就没给你做个好榜样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why didn't I set a better example?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.68,1:06:58.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也看到我多眼红吉姆父母的钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You saw how I envied Jim's parents their money.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.64,1:07:01.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拿到那些东西打算怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What were you gonna do with that stuff once you had it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.43,1:07:04.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我随口就说：“哦，我们总能给沙龙弄到钱。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I blithely say, "Oh, we'll get money for the salon somehow."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.27,1:07:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我从没说要偷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I never meant stealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.44,1:07:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，偷不是办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dear, stealing's not the way to get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.78,1:07:11.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}偷什么都得不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stealing's not the way to get anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.28,1:07:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只会惹麻烦，而你现在麻烦大了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Except trouble, and you're in a serious heap of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.70,1:07:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，爱德华，你到底为什么要这么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Edward, why ever did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.28,1:07:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都怪那些电视节目。——全都见鬼去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Damn those TV programs.   -Damn them all to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.12,1:07:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是有人唆使你干的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or did somebody put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.01,1:07:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医生，他会没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will he be okay, Doc?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.30,1:07:41.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多年的与世隔绝，使他没能具备……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The years spent in isolation have not equipped him...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.18,1:07:43.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}分辨是非的能力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with the tools necessary to judge right from wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.98,1:07:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没有参照。完全没有得到过引导。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's had no context. He's been completely without guidance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.19,1:07:51.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，他的作品——花园雕塑、发型等等——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Furthermore, his work— the garden sculptures, hairstyles and so forth—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.32,1:07:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说明他是个极富想象力的……人物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}indicate that he's a highly imaginative, uh, character.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.40,1:07:57.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很明显，他对我们所谓“现实”的认知……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It seems clear that his awareness of what we call "reality"...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.99,1:07:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}严重不足。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is radically underdeveloped.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.08,1:08:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可他在外面会没事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But will he be all right out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.08,1:08:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，会的，他会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.59,1:08:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，担心你会让我整晚睡不着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, it could keep me up all night worrying about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.84,1:08:17.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要小心点，听见没？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You watch yourself, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.43,1:08:25.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我正好没睡，听到这些动静就跑出来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just happened to be up, so I heard all this noise and I ran out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.89,1:08:30.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直就觉得他有问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All along, I felt in my gut there was something wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.36,1:08:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本来可能是我家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It could have been my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.52,1:08:35.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本来可能我们谁家都一样，可是——我警告过你，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- It could have been any of our houses, but— -! warned you, didn't 1?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.61,1:08:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在他身上看到了撒旦的印记。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw the sign of Satan on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.28,1:08:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们没听我的警告，现在你们会听了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You didn't heed my warning, but now you will...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.08,1:08:43.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为现在你们也看到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because now you can see it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.88,1:09:00.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，就待在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, just stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.05,1:09:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么要为自己辩护的？——没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you have to say in your defense?   -Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.64,1:09:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他现在不想说话。——你总得说点什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He doesn't want to talk right now.   -You have to say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.43,1:09:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？——不，他……他现在不能说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -No, h-he can't talk right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.77,1:09:11.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不能说话。——没什么要说的？没什么评论？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He can't talk.   -No comments? No remarks?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.23,1:09:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你是被人设计了吗？你当时在想什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, were you set up? What was going through your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.90,1:09:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得进屋！——你有什么要为自己说的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We have to get in the house!   -What do you have to say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.11,1:09:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他以后再跟你们说。——一句话，就说一句。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He'll talk to you later.   -One comment. Just one comment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.53,1:09:23.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪，露易丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, for goodness sakes, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.62,1:09:27.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我请你来这儿剪头发之前，咱们圣诞派对上见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna see you at our Christmas party before I get you here for your haircut.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.50,1:09:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今年当然要办啊，我们每年都办的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course we're gonna have it this year. We have it every year.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.42,1:09:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 今年为什么不办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Why wouldn't we have it this year?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.09,1:09:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也许这么想，但你错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you may think that, but you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.76,1:09:45.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.93,1:09:50.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们没伤到你吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They didn't hurt you, did they?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.48,1:09:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你害怕了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Were you scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.15,1:10:00.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让吉姆回去的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tried to make Jim go back...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.70,1:10:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你根本指挥不动吉姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you can't make Jim do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你没告诉他们我们——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for not telling them that we—
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.79,1:10:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.13,1:10:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们告诉你那是谁家房子的时候，你一定很难受吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It must have been awful when they told you whose house it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.64,1:10:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道那是吉姆家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew it was Jim's house.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.85,1:10:27.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.02,1:10:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.81,1:10:34.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你为什么还去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.48,1:10:38.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你让我去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because you asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.99,1:10:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金芭！小金！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}_ Lim] Kimba! Kimmy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.41,1:10:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.83,1:10:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别这样！  -你怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't!   -What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.75,1:10:58.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底要闹到什么时候？我能做的都做了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When are you gonna stop? I did what I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.25,1:11:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸觉得他是弱智，不然他现在还在牢里。你还想我怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My old man thinks he's retarded. Otherwise he'd still be in jail. What more do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.05,1:11:04.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你可以说实话。  -你也可以！你也在场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You could tell the truth.   -So could you! You were there too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.84,1:11:09.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不是我的主意。你知道我不想干的。  -可你还是干了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It wasn't my idea. You know I didn't want to do it.   -But you did do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.35,1:11:13.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 我真不明白你干吗这么在意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- I don't get why you give such a shit anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.42,1:11:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会想办法帮你赔偿窗帘和毛巾……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna try and help you find a way to replace the drapes and the towel...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.72,1:11:51.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们对你的信任，爱德华，可没那么容易补回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but our confidence in you, Edward, is not gonna be so easy to replace.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.47,1:11:53.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.98,1:11:56.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，来点伦理小问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. A little ethics.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.73,1:12:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你走在街上，捡到一个装满钱的手提箱，周围一个人也没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're walking down the street, find a suitcase full of money. There's nobody around.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.27,1:12:04.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有任何人证。你怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No human person is in evidence. What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.24,1:12:06.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“A”：把钱留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"A": you keep the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.66,1:12:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“B”：拿它给朋友和亲人买礼物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-"B"   -you use it to buy gifts for your friends and your loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.28,1:12:14.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“C”：把钱分给穷人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"C": you give it to the poor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.75,1:12:18.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“D”：交给警察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"D": you turn it in to the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.25,1:12:20.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-爸，这真的好傻。  -金！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Dad, this is really stupid.   -Kim!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.67,1:12:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我会把钱留下。  -消停点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'd keep the money.   -Simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.09,1:12:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.51,1:12:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，晚饭后我们去保龄球馆怎么样？肯定好玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, how 'bout after dinner we go down to the bowling alley? That would be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.55,1:12:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你今晚不见吉姆？  -不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're not seeing Jim tonight?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.60,1:12:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我们今天展示课超酷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, we had the coolest show-and-tell today.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.19,1:12:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个小孩带来一盒小负鼠——十只，也许十二只——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This kid brought in a box of baby possums— 10, maybe 12—
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.98,1:12:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光溜溜的，一根毛都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}totally naked, no hair at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.15,1:12:45.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}宝贝，这真有趣，不过你爸好像还没问完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honey, this is fascinating, but I don't think your father's finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.24,1:12:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢，亲爱的。爱德华，我们等着呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, dear. Edward, we're waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.82,1:12:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我爱的人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give it to my loved ones?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.70,1:12:59.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，爱德华，看起来确实该这么做……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Edward, it does seem that that's what you should do...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.67,1:13:01.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但其实不对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.17,1:13:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你个笨蛋！谁都知道应该交给警察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You dope! Everybody knows you're supposed to give it to the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.76,1:13:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说得好，凯文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good thinking, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.05,1:13:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们想想嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, think about it, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.85,1:13:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，那样做更好。换我就这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that's the nicer thing to do. That's what I would do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.27,1:13:21.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不是要把他搞糊涂，是想让他轻松点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're not trying to confuse him. We're trying to make things a bit easier for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.90,1:13:24.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以先别闹了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So let's cut the comedy for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.27,1:13:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是认真的，爸。那样做好多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am being serious, Dad. It's a much nicer thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.49,1:13:30.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说的不是好不好，是对和错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we're not talking nice. We're talking right and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.16,1:13:32.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-闭嘴！  -哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shut up!   -Oh, goodness sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.74,1:13:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难怪可怜的爱德华分不清是非……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No wonder poor Edward can't learn right from wrong...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.66,1:13:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住在这个家里！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}living in this family!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.83,1:13:40.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听说他把佩格的窗帘弄成什么样了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, did you hear what he did to Peg's curtains?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.92,1:13:43.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们居然还要办圣诞派对，真是难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's unbelievable that they're having their Christmas party anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.88,1:13:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你去吗？  -不去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you going?   -I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.71,1:13:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他简直差点强暴了乔伊斯，拿他那些刀吓唬她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He practically raped Joyce, you know, threatening her with those knives of his.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.84,1:13:51.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她能逃出来真是奇迹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a miracle she escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.01,1:13:54.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我对比尔和佩格没意见，可是——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I don't have anything against Bill and Peg, but—
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.35,1:13:57.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，我知道。而且他们家还有个十几岁的女儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, I know. And they've got that teenaged daughter in the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.35,1:14:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，可怜的人。想想我遭的罪。你能想象吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, those poor things. After what happened to me. Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.52,1:14:04.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟佩格怎么说圣诞派对的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you say to Peg about the Christmas party?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.98,1:14:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我说希望我们能去。  -我也撒谎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I said I hoped we could make it.   -I lied too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.88,1:14:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华？想给我剪那个新发型吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward? You want to give me that new haircut?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.97,1:14:34.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-又剪？  -嗯，当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Again?   -Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.89,1:14:39.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有你做我的私人理发师，我很骄傲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It makes me proud to have you as my own personal hairdresser.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.39,1:14:43.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗨，亲爱的。  -哦，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi, honey.   -Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.56,1:14:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-凯文，玩剪刀石头布吗？  -不玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Kevin, you wanna play "Scissors, paper, stone"?   -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.65,1:14:50.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什么？  -太无聊了。我总是赢，赢腻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why?   -It's boring. I'm tired of always winning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.24,1:14:53.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-也想想别人的感受——讲点礼貌！  -我去外面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Other people's feelings— A few manners!   -I'll be outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.24,1:14:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管他，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just never you mind, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.41,1:14:57.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就——你剪吧。尽管剪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just— You cut away. Cut away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.16,1:15:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ot
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.76,1:15:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}»
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.60,1:15:20.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.77,1:15:24.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还需要点……别的。你觉得呢，亲爱的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It needs something... else. What do you think, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.35,1:15:27.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-再加点铃铛？  -加点铃铛。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-More bells?   -More bells. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.36,1:15:30.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈，你真觉得我们该办这个派对吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mom, do you really think we should be having this party?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.15,1:15:33.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然觉得该办，当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course I think we should be having this party. Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.78,1:15:36.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正好能让一切平静下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just what we need just to calm things down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.53,1:15:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都会恢复正常的。嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And everything will just go back to normal. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.95,1:15:44.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还有别的铃铛吗，亲爱的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any more bells, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.27,1:17:32.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.94,1:17:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这下你可闯祸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now you've done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.44,1:17:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是擦破点皮，吉姆。真的，没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just a scratch, Jim. Really, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.07,1:17:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！你再碰她一下，我就杀了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay back! Touch her again, and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.41,1:17:45.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没什么大不了的。  -快叫医生。他把金刺伤了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's no big deal.   -Call a doctor. He skewered Kim.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.00,1:17:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不！他没刺伤我。  -离她远点，行吗？我说真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No! He didn't skewer me.   -Stay away from her, okay? I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.83,1:17:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你碰什么毁什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't touch anything without destroying it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.00,1:17:53.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你是谁，在这儿晃来晃去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who the hell do you think you are, hanging around?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.25,1:17:57.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我坐下，等我去拿点冰来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to sit right down and wait for me to bring you some ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.92,1:18:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就待在那儿。我马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay right there. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.43,1:18:06.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}［未完待续］\N{\rEN\blur0.8}¢e I Continues ]
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.43,1:18:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.85,1:18:12.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去！走开！怪物！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the hell out! Go! Freak!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.19,1:18:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，爱德华！你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Edward! Where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.66,1:18:24.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他在哪儿？  -他想伤害你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where is he?   -He tried to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.99,1:18:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他没有，你心里清楚。  -你疯了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, he did not, and you know it.   -Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.20,1:18:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我亲眼看见的！  -吉姆，我不爱你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I just saw him!   -Jim, I don't love you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.04,1:18:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想你走！行吗？快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want you to go! Okay? Just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.04,1:18:37.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.21,1:18:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就这么输给那东西？他连人都不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna lose you to that? He isn't even human.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.01,1:18:42.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你快出去！行吗？快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just get out of here! Okay? Just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.35,1:18:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，你看见爱德华往哪儿去了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, did you see where Edward went?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.69,1:18:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。他就那么顺着街走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I don't know. He just waltzed down the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.48,1:18:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们得去找他，妈。  -你爸会找到他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We have to go find him, Mom.   -Your father will find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.40,1:19:01.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进屋去吧。我来处理。我去找他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on in the house. I'll take care of it. I'll go find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.07,1:19:04.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}22\N{\rEN\blur0.8}22
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.05,1:19:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！爱德华！我要报警了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Edward! I'm calling the police!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.94,1:19:36.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}2\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.43,1:20:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 那么多血，亲爱的，其实只是个小口子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- All that blood, sweetie, and it was just a little cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.60,1:20:18.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.57,1:20:27.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，博格斯太太。我来找那个手是剪刀的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Mrs. Boggs. I'm here to see the man with the hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.12,1:20:31.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。呃——\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Uh—
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.58,1:20:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不在这儿。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.58,1:20:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.96,1:20:42.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-海伦。海伦，你真的看见他了吗？  -看见了！你看！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Helen. Helen, did you actually see him?   -Yes! Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.42,1:20:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都别闹了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Don't start, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.51,1:20:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在找那个剪刀手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm looking for the man with the scissors.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.72,1:20:54.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢天谢地你来了。  -他往那边去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thank God you're here.   -He went right down there that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.22,1:20:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。冷静。冷静。回家去吧。我们来处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Calm down. Calm down. Go on home. We'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.64,1:20:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都回家去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.81,1:21:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他是恶魔。恶魔。  -你们得抓住他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's a demon. A demon.   -You've gotta catch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.61,1:21:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你们得想想办法！  -我想他在我家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You've gotta do something!   -I think he's at my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.20,1:21:14.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸肯定很快就能找到他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure your father will find him soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.45,1:21:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几点了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.04,1:21:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快八点半了。派对很棒吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's almost 8:30. Great party, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.29,1:21:23.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们人呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.00,1:21:26.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，希望他没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.72,1:21:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也希望，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So do I, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.22,1:21:38.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，当初我把爱德华带下来跟我们一起住……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, when I brought Edward down here to live with us...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.48,1:21:41.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真没把事情想清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really didn't think things through.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.06,1:21:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也没想过他会出什么事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I didn't think about what could happen to him...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.65,1:21:48.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者我们会怎样……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or to us...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.82,1:21:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者这街区会怎样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or to the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.41,1:21:54.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我觉得，也许……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now I think that maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.37,1:21:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他最好是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it might be best if he goes...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.83,1:22:02.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回到上面去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}back up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.75,1:22:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为至少在那儿，他是安全的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because at least there, he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.42,1:22:10.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们也能恢复正常生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we'd just go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.68,1:22:15.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我走到惠特曼家一半路，哪儿都没看见他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I got halfway to the Whitmans'. I didn't see him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.89,1:22:19.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎，天哪。天哪。那我们上车去找他吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, dear. Oh, dear. Well, let's get in the car and go look for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.27,1:22:21.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-凯文现在在哪儿？  -他在马克斯家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where's Kevin now?   -He's at Max's.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.44,1:22:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天啊。你以为你要去哪儿，小姐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, for God's sakes. Where do you think you're going, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.52,1:22:27.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-跟你们一起去。  -不行，你留在这儿，万一有人来呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-With you guys.   -No, you're staying here in case somebody shows up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.73,1:22:29.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们很快就回来，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll be right back, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.65,1:23:11.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Police.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.31,1:23:49.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.98,1:23:54.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.45,1:23:58.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.16,1:24:03.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都去哪儿了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.33,1:24:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出去找你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.96,1:24:14.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱抱我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.81,1:24:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.68,1:25:01.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道现在过圣诞还早了点，爱德华……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know it's a little early for Christmas, Edward...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.51,1:25:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.56,1:25:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个礼物送你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.64,1:27:10.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别管牵手了。想想他还能在别的地方造成什么伤害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget holding her hand. Picture the damage he could do other places.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.31,1:27:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。真恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. That's sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.52,1:27:21.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我要晕过去或者吐了什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feel like I'm gonna pass out or puke or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.65,1:27:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}待会儿。先带我去她家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Later. First take me to her house.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.24,1:27:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别这样，吉姆。别让我开车。  -照做就行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, come on, Jim. Don't make me drive.   -Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.78,1:27:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。也许她说得没错，你就是那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus. Maybe she was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.50,1:27:32.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-开车！  -放松点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Just drive!   -Relax!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.67,1:27:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-明天见。打给我。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-See you tomorrow. Call me.   -All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.86,1:28:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们抓到他了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have they caught him yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.32,1:28:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谁？  -他——那个残废。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who?   -Him— that cripple.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.49,1:28:09.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。抓到了告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Let me know when they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.95,1:28:14.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉大伙儿，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let us all know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.96,1:28:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乖孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.06,1:28:39.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.48,1:28:47.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 你没事吧？哦！没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Are you okay? Oh! It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.49,1:28:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 哎哟！哎哟！哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Ow! Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.99,1:28:54.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，住手。住手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, stop. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.45,1:28:56.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别！住手！  -爱德华，住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't! Stop!   -Edward, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.08,1:29:00.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁来帮帮我们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody help us!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.63,1:29:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-救命！  -你在干什么？离他远点！哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Help!   -What are you doing? Get away from him! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.72,1:29:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快报警！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody call the police!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.60,1:29:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-放开我！  -为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let go of me!   -Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.77,1:29:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.14,1:29:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-喂！放开他！  -凯文！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey! Get off of him!   -Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.19,1:29:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-走开！  -爱德华，回家。回家吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get away!   -Edward, come home. Come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.58,1:29:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！住手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.81,1:29:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.74,1:30:09.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}[警笛声持续]\N{\rEN\blur0.8}[ Siren Continues I
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.46,1:30:30.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}凯文没事！只是划破了一点点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kevin's all right! It was just the tiniest scratch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.01,1:30:33.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他走了。别去打扰他了。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he's gone. Let's not bother him. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.05,1:30:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他一个人待着吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Let's just leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.77,1:30:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去吧，快跑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on, run.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.20,1:30:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-出什么事了？  -他死了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What happened?   -Okay, is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.36,1:30:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-抓到他了吗？  -都结束了。回家吧。没什么好看的了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you get him?   -It's all over. Go on home. There's nothing more to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.20,1:30:59.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那边出什么事了？  -我不想回家！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What happened out there?   -I don't want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.70,1:31:01.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想知道。你得给我个说法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to know. I want some answers from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.96,1:31:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.12,1:31:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在哪儿？他在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is he? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.92,1:31:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来！我有话问你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get back here! I want to ask you something!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.93,1:31:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我想问你件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.76,1:31:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 你看见了吗—— - 看那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Did you see— - Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.10,1:31:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那辆车里没人。  -他们没抓到他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-There's nobody in that car.   -They don't have him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.31,1:31:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们该怎么办？  -我走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What are we gonna do?   -I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.48,1:31:26.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别。小心点。  -这可不是个好主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. Careful.   -That's not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.80,1:32:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们来了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.51,1:32:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我伤到凯文了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I hurt Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.72,1:32:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。他没事。主要是被吓着了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. He's okay. Mostly he was just scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.14,1:32:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱德华，我好害怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Edward, I was so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.52,1:32:48.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.57,1:32:58.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.46,1:33:11.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.47,1:33:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！完！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! fim!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.72,1:33:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！不要！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.86,1:33:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.28,1:33:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手，不然我亲手杀了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it or I'll kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.29,1:33:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 胡说八道！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.30,1:34:00.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！我说了离她远点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! I said stay away from her!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.94,1:35:01.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.54,1:35:15.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.30,1:36:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在里面吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is he in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.05,1:36:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.85,1:36:15.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}屋顶塌下来压住了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The roof caved in on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.02,1:36:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们互相残杀了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They killed each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.07,1:36:23.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们自己看吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can see for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.86,1:36:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看见了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.58,1:36:38.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.43,1:36:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.65,1:37:09.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她再也没见过他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She never saw him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.58,1:37:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那晚之后就再没见过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not after that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.87,1:37:14.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.30,1:37:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我在场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.26,1:37:28.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你本可以去上面找他。现在也还可以去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could have gone up there. You still could go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.30,1:37:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不了，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.64,1:37:35.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在是个老太婆了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm an old woman now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.85,1:37:39.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我宁愿他记住我原来的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would rather he remember me the way I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.10,1:38:15.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么知道他还在世？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you know he's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.81,1:38:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……不知道，不能确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... don't know, not for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.31,1:38:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是……我相信他还活着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But... I believe he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.66,1:38:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}YOU See...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.83,1:38:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在他下山来这里之前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before he came down here...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.83,1:38:41.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里从来不下雪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it never snowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.67,1:38:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可在那之后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And afterwards...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.84,1:38:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就下雪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.34,1:38:54.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他现在不在上面……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If he weren't up there now...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.01,1:38:58.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想这里就不会下雪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think it would be snowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.68,1:39:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候你还能看到我在雪里跳舞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes you can still catch me dancing in it.
